[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14946.95, "timestamp": "04:09:06", "text": "違う。我が神よ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14956.79, "timestamp": "04:09:16", "text": "ああ、私が揺れるとき、私の椅子が見えるよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14959.03, "timestamp": "04:09:19", "text": "椅子に戻った。それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14964.389, "timestamp": "04:09:24", "text": "おお。ニース。どうやって追跡するのですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14968.229, "timestamp": "04:09:28", "text": "あなたの持ち物？あなたのカメラは顔追跡機能を備えています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14971.83, "timestamp": "04:09:31", "text": "などなど。職業はなんですか？えっと、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14973.91, "timestamp": "04:09:33", "text": "私は持っています、いいえ、私は持っています、私は私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14975.67, "timestamp": "04:09:35", "text": "別の電話。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14978.87, "timestamp": "04:09:38", "text": "例えば、予備のバーチャルアシスタントがあるので、それを使っています。それ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14981.349, "timestamp": "04:09:41", "text": "ウェブカメラよりも優れている。カメラのように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14983.11, "timestamp": "04:09:43", "text": "その電話のいくつかのほうがずっと優れている"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 14994.679, "timestamp": "04:09:54", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "*spare iphone *"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14996.83, "timestamp": "04:09:56", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 14999.316, "timestamp": "04:09:59", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ahem"}]